# Swamp of Sorrows (Horde) - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every rank-flagged rare spawning in Swamp of Sorrows (zone key 1435) a
# Horde player can engage (5 shipped, 4 excluded far above band), and every
# fixed treasure object (8 shippable families plus the Caravan Chest unique),
# verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever NPC/object/
# item dumps). Rares with 2+ points loop over ALL data-confirmed points;
# single-point rares get plain steps. Every goal is optional - a missing
# spawn never wedges the guide. Signature drops ride as optional collects;
# everything else gets a kill-note. No accept/turnin lines anywhere. See
# docs/swamp-of-sorrows-horde-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory.
guide butler-routes-completionist/swamp-of-sorrows-horde-rares
title Swamp of Sorrows (Horde) - Rares & Treasures
levels 30-38
zone Swamp of Sorrows
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords swamp of sorrows, horde, rares, treasures, collectibles, companions
coords live
version 1

step Fallow Sanctuary - Lost One Cook

  zone map 1435

  loop
  goto 60.93,24.28
  goto 61.82,21.85
  goto 62.39,20.9
  goto 62.5,23.31
  goto 63.98,22.8
  goto 65.23,22.8
  kill 1106 optional
  collect 250186 "Giant Scrambled Eggs" optional
  note Lost One Cook (level 37) loops the Sanctuary. 250186 is his exclusive drop anywhere in the data. The Worn Stone Token ground objective of uncontracted quest 699 Stitches the Outcast (deferred to companions by the Horde census) has no item record in the data, so no collect ships for it - no quest line ships here either. No core quest takes the Cook.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

