step The southern inlet - Fingat

  zone map 1435

  goto 61.43,83.72
  kill 14446 optional
  note Fingat (level 43) sits above the 30-38 band - come back later. Single Swamp point; he also spawns in the Blasted Lands. Fish, clams and pearls; no signature loot. No core quest takes him.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

