step The Caravan Chest

  zone map 1435

  goto 64.46,18.3
  interact 28024 optional
  note Fixed chest holding the Wizards' Reagents for Alliance-only quest 1421 The Lost Caravan - for Horde it is a dead-end container (the Horde twin 1422 Threat From the Sea is a talk-through that never touches it), opened for generic value.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Left out, logged in the inventory

  zone map 1435

  note Lord Captain Wyrmak, Jade, Veyzhak the Cannibal and Zekkis sit +7 to +11 over the band on single points with no shippable signature - excluded far above band (signatures logged in the inventory). The Soggy Scroll is furniture of uncontracted below-band records, PH-adjacent decor, not a treasure. No tame lines ship: tameability has no data flag and the core guide carries no tame corroboration.
